1
00:00:01,007 --> 00:00:02,967
♪

2
00:00:05,467 --> 00:00:06,637
Alice: GO ON, THEN.

3
00:00:06,637 --> 00:00:08,847
HOWEVER, IF I DETECT

4
00:00:08,847 --> 00:00:11,057
EVEN A TRACE OF DECEIT
IN YOUR WORDS...

5
00:00:12,437 --> 00:00:13,727
I SHALL END YOUR LIFE.

6
00:00:13,727 --> 00:00:15,607
( Kirito gasps )

7
00:00:15,607 --> 00:00:17,357
FINE BY ME.

8
00:00:17,357 --> 00:00:19,317
YOU SHOULD DO
WHAT YOU THINK IS RIGHT,

9
00:00:19,317 --> 00:00:22,237
AS LONG AS YOU’RE NOT
JUST BLINDLY FOLLOWING ORDERS.

10
00:00:22,237 --> 00:00:23,657
( Alice groans )

11
00:00:23,657 --> 00:00:25,197
Kirito: I SAY THAT,

12
00:00:25,197 --> 00:00:26,787
’CAUSE YOU WON’T KNOW
THE DIFFERENCE.

13
00:00:26,787 --> 00:00:28,407
YOU DON’T REALIZE IT,

14
00:00:28,407 --> 00:00:31,377
BUT EVERYTHING YOU’VE
BEEN FIGHTING FOR AS A KNIGHT

15
00:00:31,377 --> 00:00:34,037
WAS PLANTED IN YOUR HEAD
BY SOMEONE ELSE.

16
00:00:34,037 --> 00:00:37,337
EVERYONE KNOWS THE STORY,
THAT YOU KNIGHTS

17
00:00:37,337 --> 00:00:39,757
WERE CALLED DOWN FROM HEAVEN
BY ADMINISTRATOR,

18
00:00:39,757 --> 00:00:41,887
THE PONTIFEX OF THE CHURCH,

19
00:00:41,887 --> 00:00:45,507
TO MAINTAIN ORDER IN THIS WORLD
AND DOLE OUT JUSTICE.

20
00:00:45,507 --> 00:00:46,677
BUT BEING SUMMONED’S

21
00:00:46,677 --> 00:00:48,887
THE OLDEST MEMORY
YOU KNIGHTS HAVE.

22
00:00:48,887 --> 00:00:53,267
THINK BACK. DO YOU REMEMBER
WHAT HEAVEN WAS LIKE?

23
00:00:53,267 --> 00:00:56,477
OR YOUR CHILDHOOD?
OR YOUR PARENTS?

24
00:00:56,477 --> 00:00:59,027
Alice: WELL, NO. OF COURSE NOT.

25
00:00:59,027 --> 00:01:01,527
OUR MEMORIES OF HEAVEN
HAVE BEEN SEALED.

26
00:01:01,527 --> 00:01:03,697
I WAS TOLD
THE GODDESS STACIA DOES THAT

27
00:01:03,697 --> 00:01:05,237
THE MOMENT WE ARE SUMMONED HERE.

28
00:01:05,237 --> 00:01:06,487
Kirito: YOU GOT THE PART

29
00:01:06,487 --> 00:01:08,537
ABOUT YOUR MEMORIES
BEING SEALED RIGHT,

30
00:01:08,537 --> 00:01:11,247
BUT STACIA ISN’T THE ONE
WHO DID THAT TO YOU.

31
00:01:11,247 --> 00:01:12,917
IT WAS THE PONTIFEX,

32
00:01:12,917 --> 00:01:14,747
AND SHE DIDN’T BLOCK
MEMORIES OF HEAVEN,

33
00:01:14,747 --> 00:01:16,587
BUT YOUR MEMORIES OF HERE.

34
00:01:16,587 --> 00:01:18,707
ALL YOU KNIGHTS
WERE BORN AND RAISED HUMAN

35
00:01:18,707 --> 00:01:20,417
RIGHT HERE IN THIS WORLD.

36
00:01:20,417 --> 00:01:24,587
YOU HAVE A HUMAN NAME,
ALICE ZUBERG.

37
00:01:24,587 --> 00:01:26,257
YOUR FOLKS RAISED YOU

38
00:01:26,257 --> 00:01:28,517
IN A TINY VILLAGE UP NORTH
CALLED RULID.

39
00:01:28,517 --> 00:01:29,517
( Alice gasps )

40
00:01:29,517 --> 00:01:31,557
Kirito: WHEN YOU WERE 11,

41
00:01:31,557 --> 00:01:34,307
YOU WENT TO EXPLORE A CAVE THAT
RAN THROUGH THE END MOUNTAINS

42
00:01:34,307 --> 00:01:36,317
TO THE DARK TERRITORY.

43
00:01:36,317 --> 00:01:37,937
WHEN YOU CAME OUT
THE OTHER SIDE,

44
00:01:37,937 --> 00:01:40,437
YOU TOUCHED
THE GROUND ON ACCIDENT.

45
00:01:40,437 --> 00:01:43,317
YOU TRESPASSED
ON THE DARK TERRITORY.

46
00:01:43,317 --> 00:01:45,197
YOU BROKE THE LAW.

47
00:01:45,197 --> 00:01:47,277
♪

48
00:01:47,277 --> 00:01:49,407
( Alice gasps )

49
00:01:49,407 --> 00:01:52,407
ALICE ZUBERG.

50
00:01:52,407 --> 00:01:55,497
I HAVE A HUMAN NAME?

51
00:01:55,497 --> 00:01:58,547
THE END MOUNTAINS A-AND RULID.

52
00:01:58,547 --> 00:02:01,297
I CANNOT REMEMBER, NONE OF IT.

53
00:02:01,297 --> 00:02:03,177
Kirito: YEAH, WELL,
DON’T FORCE YOURSELF.

54
00:02:03,177 --> 00:02:04,757
YOU’LL END UP LIKE ELDRIE.

55
00:02:04,757 --> 00:02:06,677
Alice: IT IS
TOO LATE TO STOP NOW!

56
00:02:06,677 --> 00:02:08,097
GO ON.

57
00:02:09,257 --> 00:02:11,767
TELL ME EVERYTHING.

58
00:02:11,767 --> 00:02:13,387
( singing in Japanese )

59
00:02:13,387 --> 00:02:16,147
♪

60
00:02:44,627 --> 00:02:46,927
♪ PROUD OF MYSELF ♪

61
00:02:54,427 --> 00:02:56,097
♪

62
00:03:51,107 --> 00:03:53,697
Kirito: YOUR FATHER’S
THE VILLAGE ELDER OF RULID.

63
00:03:53,697 --> 00:03:56,817
HIS NAME’S GASFUT ZUBERG.

64
00:03:56,817 --> 00:04:00,487
I DON’T KNOW YOUR MOM’S NAME,
BUT, LIKE I TOLD YOU BEFORE,

65
00:04:00,487 --> 00:04:04,287
YOU HAVE A LITTLE SISTER.
I MET HER. HER NAME’S SELKA.

66
00:04:04,287 --> 00:04:05,917
Alice: SELKA.

67
00:04:05,917 --> 00:04:08,377
Kirito: EVER SINCE YOU
WERE TAKEN AWAY BY THE CHURCH,

68
00:04:08,377 --> 00:04:10,457
SHE’S BEEN WORRIED SICK.

69
00:04:10,457 --> 00:04:13,547
WHEN YOU LIVED IN RULID,
YOU WERE A SISTER-IN-TRAINING

70
00:04:13,547 --> 00:04:15,877
AND REALLY GOOD
AT THE SACRED ARTS.

71
00:04:15,877 --> 00:04:18,597
NOW SELKA’S
A SISTER-IN-TRAINING, TOO,

72
00:04:18,597 --> 00:04:21,177
AND SHE’S WORKING HARD TO GET
AS GOOD AT THE ARTS AS YOU.

73
00:04:23,227 --> 00:04:25,767
Alice: YOUR GOAL, AS YOU STATED,

74
00:04:25,767 --> 00:04:28,227
WAS NOT TREASON
AGAINST THE CHURCH,

75
00:04:28,227 --> 00:04:30,687
BUT TO BRING
THE PONTIFEX TO JUSTICE

76
00:04:30,687 --> 00:04:32,897
AND PROTECT
THE HUMAN REALM, YES?

77
00:04:32,897 --> 00:04:35,697
Kirito: YEAH. THAT’S THE PLAN.

78
00:04:35,697 --> 00:04:38,067
Alice: AND YET
WE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS

79
00:04:38,067 --> 00:04:41,407
HAVE A DUTY TO PROTECT
THE HUMAN REALM AS WELL.

80
00:04:41,407 --> 00:04:43,247
WE DEFEND IT AGAINST INVASION

81
00:04:43,247 --> 00:04:47,077
BY THE DARK TERRITORY
AT ALL COSTS.

82
00:04:47,077 --> 00:04:50,457
IF YOU MANAGE TO DEFEAT
ALL OF THE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS

83
00:04:50,457 --> 00:04:53,167
AS WELL AS SLAY
THE PONTIFEX HERSELF,

84
00:04:53,167 --> 00:04:56,877
WHAT THEN? THERE WOULD BE
NO ONE TO PROTECT THIS REALM.

85
00:04:56,877 --> 00:04:58,967
Kirito: WELL,
LET ME ASK YOU THIS.

86
00:04:58,967 --> 00:05:00,677
IF THE DARK TERRITORY INVADES

87
00:05:00,677 --> 00:05:03,097
AND ALL OF YOU KNIGHTS
HIT ’EM FULL FORCE,

88
00:05:03,097 --> 00:05:06,637
THAT’S ONLY GONNA BE, WHAT,
A LITTLE OVER 30 OF YOU?

89
00:05:06,637 --> 00:05:08,767
DO YOU HONESTLY THINK
THAT’S ENOUGH TO BEAT ’EM BACK?

90
00:05:08,767 --> 00:05:11,357
( Alice sighs )

91
00:05:11,357 --> 00:05:13,647
Bercouli: PRIME SENATOR,

92
00:05:13,647 --> 00:05:16,857
YOU NEED TO TALK TO THE PONTIFEX
ABOUT THE DARK TERRITORY.

93
00:05:16,857 --> 00:05:19,407
EVERY DAY,
THEIR ARMY GETS BIGGER.

94
00:05:19,407 --> 00:05:21,947
IT’S A MATTER OF TIME
BEFORE THEY ATTACK.

95
00:05:21,947 --> 00:05:23,827
I’M WORRIED THERE’S
NOT ENOUGH OF US KNIGHTS

96
00:05:23,827 --> 00:05:25,327
TO TAKE ’EM ALL ON.

97
00:05:25,327 --> 00:05:26,827
Chudelkin: THAT’S YOUR PROBLEM!

98
00:05:26,827 --> 00:05:29,037
YOU ARE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS,

99
00:05:29,037 --> 00:05:31,837
SO USE YOUR BRAINS,
AND FIGURE IT OUT YOURSELF!

100
00:05:31,837 --> 00:05:34,087
( gasps )
WE ARE DONE TALKING ABOUT THIS.

101
00:05:34,087 --> 00:05:36,547
TRUST IN THE PONTIFEX,
DO AS YOU’RE TOLD,

102
00:05:36,547 --> 00:05:39,297
AND ALL WILL BE FINE. HONESTLY!

103
00:05:39,297 --> 00:05:41,427
( Bercouli sighs )

104
00:05:41,427 --> 00:05:44,307
Alice: ACTUALLY, YOU’RE RIGHT.

105
00:05:44,307 --> 00:05:48,267
EVEN UNC--OR, RATHER,
COMMANDER BERCOULI

106
00:05:48,267 --> 00:05:51,557
HAD MISGIVINGS ABOUT
OUR NUMBERS COMPARED TO THEIRS.

107
00:05:51,557 --> 00:05:54,067
ASIDE FROM US KNIGHTS,
THE HUMAN EMPIRE

108
00:05:54,067 --> 00:05:56,027
DOES NOT HAVE
AN ARMY AT THE READY,

109
00:05:56,027 --> 00:05:57,897
SHOULD WAR BREAK OUT.

110
00:05:57,897 --> 00:06:00,027
Kirito: I KNOW, AND THE REASON

111
00:06:00,027 --> 00:06:02,947
WE DON’T HAVE AN ARMY
IS ADMINISTRATOR’S FAULT.

112
00:06:02,947 --> 00:06:05,077
YOU KNOW WHY THAT IS?

113
00:06:05,077 --> 00:06:07,327
IT’S ’CAUSE SHE’S SCARED THAT,
IF THE PEOPLE HAD WEAPONS,

114
00:06:07,327 --> 00:06:10,117
THEY COULD ALL
RISE UP AGAINST HER.

115
00:06:10,117 --> 00:06:14,127
IF A WAR HAPPENS, THE NOBLES ARE
SUPPOSED TO PROTECT THE WEAK,

116
00:06:14,127 --> 00:06:18,047
BUT SHE LET THE UPPER CLASS
GET LAZY AND CORRUPT.

117
00:06:18,047 --> 00:06:20,547
THEY JUST CARE
ABOUT THEMSELVES NOW.

118
00:06:20,547 --> 00:06:22,217
THIS WORLD’S
RUNNING OUT OF TIME,

119
00:06:22,217 --> 00:06:25,257
BUT IT STILL HAS A CHANCE.
IF WE CAN GET THE WORD OUT

120
00:06:25,257 --> 00:06:28,387
BEFORE THE ARMIES OF THE DARK
SHOW UP, WE CAN FIGHT.

121
00:06:28,387 --> 00:06:30,687
WITH ENOUGH PEOPLE,
WE CAN BUILD OUR OWN ARMY.

122
00:06:30,687 --> 00:06:33,937
Alice: THAT IS IMPOSSIBLE!
AN ARMY?

123
00:06:33,937 --> 00:06:36,777
YOU JUST SAID
HOW CORRUPT THE NOBLES ARE!

124
00:06:36,777 --> 00:06:39,397
THEY WOULD PROTECT THEIR OWN
INTERESTS BEFORE ANYONE ELSE.

125
00:06:39,397 --> 00:06:41,567
Kirito: YEAH, SOME OF ’EM,

126
00:06:41,567 --> 00:06:44,447
BUT THEY’RE
JUST A SMALL GROUP OF PEOPLE.

127
00:06:44,447 --> 00:06:46,447
NOT EVERYONE
THINKS LIKE THEY DO.

128
00:06:46,447 --> 00:06:48,537
THE LOWER-CLASS NOBLES
AND COMMONERS

129
00:06:48,537 --> 00:06:50,867
WOULD JOIN THE FIGHT
IN A HEARTBEAT.

130
00:06:50,867 --> 00:06:52,327
Alice: THE COMMONERS, TOO?

131
00:06:52,327 --> 00:06:55,537
Kirito: UH-HUH. ALL WE DO
IS HAND OUT THE WEAPONS

132
00:06:55,537 --> 00:06:57,957
YOU GUYS HAVE GOT STASHED
HERE IN THE TOWER.

133
00:06:57,957 --> 00:07:00,877
THEN WE TEACH EVERYONE
THE SAME SWORD SKILLS

134
00:07:00,877 --> 00:07:02,877
AND SACRED ARTS
YOU KNIGHTS KNOW.

135
00:07:02,877 --> 00:07:06,927
IF WE DO THAT, WE COULD
BUILD AN ARMY IN A YEAR OR SO.

136
00:07:06,927 --> 00:07:08,717
THING IS, AT THIS POINT,

137
00:07:08,717 --> 00:07:12,017
IT CAN’T HAPPEN IF THE PONTIFEX
IS STILL IN CHARGE.

138
00:07:12,017 --> 00:07:14,897
YOU KNOW WHAT SCARES HER MORE
THAN THE FORCES OF THE DARK?

139
00:07:14,897 --> 00:07:16,977
IT’S PEOPLE HAVING FREE WILL.

140
00:07:16,977 --> 00:07:20,607
IF SHE CAN’T HAVE AN ARMY LOYAL
TO HER, THERE WON’T BE AN ARMY,

141
00:07:20,607 --> 00:07:22,737
SO I SAY WE THROW A COUP.

142
00:07:22,737 --> 00:07:25,157
IF WE CAN BRING DOWN
ADMINISTRATOR,

143
00:07:25,157 --> 00:07:26,827
WE’LL FREE ALL THE PEOPLE.

144
00:07:26,827 --> 00:07:28,867
THEN, WE CAN USE
THE TIME WE GOT LEFT

145
00:07:28,867 --> 00:07:31,367
TO TRAIN THEM ALL TO FIGHT,
AND, WITH ANY LUCK,

146
00:07:31,367 --> 00:07:33,577
WE’LL HAVE AN ARMY BIG ENOUGH
TO STOP THE INVASION.

147
00:07:37,247 --> 00:07:39,707
Alice: THE FACT
THESE MINIONS ARE HERE,

148
00:07:39,707 --> 00:07:41,717
THAT ALONE IS PROOF

149
00:07:41,717 --> 00:07:44,967
OF THE CONTEMPT
THE PONTIFEX HAS FOR US KNIGHTS,

150
00:07:44,967 --> 00:07:47,047
HER MOST LOYAL SERVANTS,

151
00:07:47,047 --> 00:07:48,637
AND THE PEOPLE.

152
00:07:52,977 --> 00:07:54,647
( wind blowing )

153
00:08:04,527 --> 00:08:06,567
- ALL RIGHT, THEN.
- ( Kirito gasps )

154
00:08:06,567 --> 00:08:10,367
Alice: I’LL HELP
UNDER ONE CONDITION.

155
00:08:10,367 --> 00:08:13,157
I WANT YOUR WORD THAT,
WHEN I REGAIN MY MEMORY,

156
00:08:13,157 --> 00:08:16,917
I WILL GET TO SEE
MY SISTER SELKA AGAIN.

157
00:08:16,917 --> 00:08:18,037
( Kirito grunts )

158
00:08:21,837 --> 00:08:24,257
YEAH, OF COURSE. YOU WILL.

159
00:08:24,257 --> 00:08:26,257
IT’S JUST,
WHEN YOU DO GET IT BACK,

160
00:08:26,257 --> 00:08:30,007
YOU’RE NOT GONNA BE
WHO YOU ARE RIGHT NOW ANYMORE.

161
00:08:30,007 --> 00:08:31,887
ALICE SYNTHESIS THIRTY,

162
00:08:31,887 --> 00:08:34,307
THE INTEGRITY KNIGHT,
WILL BE GONE,

163
00:08:34,307 --> 00:08:37,647
AND ALL THE MEMORIES
YOU HAVE NOW WILL BE GONE.

164
00:08:37,647 --> 00:08:40,317
YOU’LL GO BACK
TO BEING ALICE ZUBERG,

165
00:08:40,317 --> 00:08:42,527
THE GIRL
FROM A VILLAGE UP NORTH.

166
00:08:45,817 --> 00:08:47,527
Alice: SELKA.

167
00:08:47,527 --> 00:08:49,617
SELKA. ( gasps )

168
00:08:49,617 --> 00:08:51,277
♪

169
00:08:51,277 --> 00:08:54,827
I CANNOT REMEMBER
HER FACE OR HER VOICE,

170
00:08:54,827 --> 00:08:59,167
BUT WHEN I SAY HER NAME,
IT IS FAMILIAR TO ME.

171
00:08:59,167 --> 00:09:02,497
MY LIPS, THROAT, AND HEART,

172
00:09:02,497 --> 00:09:04,127
THEY REMEMBER.

173
00:09:05,967 --> 00:09:09,507
I USED TO SAY THAT NAME
ALL THE TIME.

174
00:09:09,507 --> 00:09:12,597
SELKA. SELKA.

175
00:09:12,597 --> 00:09:14,267
♪

176
00:09:19,477 --> 00:09:23,107
I KNOW IN MY SOUL
I HAVE A FAMILY...

177
00:09:24,187 --> 00:09:27,857
A FATHER, A MOTHER, A SISTER,

178
00:09:27,857 --> 00:09:29,157
MY OWN FLESH AND BLOOD...

179
00:09:31,827 --> 00:09:35,907
SOMEWHERE OUT THERE,
UNDER THE STARS.

180
00:09:39,667 --> 00:09:41,327
( sobbing )

181
00:09:45,207 --> 00:09:47,127
( sobbing continues )

182
00:09:57,227 --> 00:09:59,517
WHEN YOU SAID BEFORE

183
00:09:59,517 --> 00:10:03,977
THAT WE KNIGHTS WERE NOT CALLED,
BUT CREATED BY THE PONTIFEX,

184
00:10:03,977 --> 00:10:05,937
IT CONFIRMED
WHAT I HAVE SUSPECTED.

185
00:10:05,937 --> 00:10:08,197
THIS BODY,

186
00:10:08,197 --> 00:10:12,117
THE ONE I HAVE BEEN OCCUPYING
FOR THE PAST SIX YEARS,

187
00:10:12,117 --> 00:10:14,827
WAS STOLEN FROM ANOTHER.

188
00:10:14,827 --> 00:10:15,907
I KNOW THAT NOW.

189
00:10:17,827 --> 00:10:21,247
THEREFORE, I SHALL RETURN
WHAT WAS STOLEN.

190
00:10:21,247 --> 00:10:26,207
IT IS WHAT SELKA, HER PARENTS,
AND YOUR FRIEND WOULD WANT.

191
00:10:26,207 --> 00:10:29,007
I AM SURE YOU WOULD WANT THAT
AS WELL, YES?

192
00:10:29,007 --> 00:10:30,837
Kirito: WELL, YEAH.

193
00:10:30,837 --> 00:10:34,807
Alice: BUT FIRST
I HAVE ONE FAVOR TO ASK.

194
00:10:34,807 --> 00:10:37,097
- Kirito: WHAT?
- Alice: IF YOU WOULD,

195
00:10:37,097 --> 00:10:40,477
BEFORE YOU RETURN
THE ORIGINAL ALICE’S MEMORY,

196
00:10:40,477 --> 00:10:43,977
I WOULD LIKE YOU TO
ACCOMPANY ME TO RULID VILLAGE.

197
00:10:43,977 --> 00:10:45,647
I WISH TO VISIT THERE,

198
00:10:45,647 --> 00:10:48,937
BUT I DO NOT WANT TO BE SEEN,
JUST OBSERVE.

199
00:10:48,937 --> 00:10:54,067
AND, IF YOU WOULD, PLEASE
POINT SELKA AND MY FAMILY OUT.

200
00:10:54,067 --> 00:10:58,787
GRANT ME THAT,
AND I WOULD BE MOST GRATEFUL.

201
00:10:58,787 --> 00:11:00,247
Kirito: SURE.

202
00:11:00,247 --> 00:11:03,207
YOU GOT IT. I SWEAR...

203
00:11:03,207 --> 00:11:05,417
BEFORE WE RESTORE YOUR MEMORY,

204
00:11:05,417 --> 00:11:07,337
I’LL TAKE YOU BACK
TO RULID TO SEE ’EM.

205
00:11:07,337 --> 00:11:08,917
Alice: YOU HAD BETTER.

206
00:11:15,797 --> 00:11:17,507
♪

207
00:11:22,017 --> 00:11:24,807
( sighs )

208
00:11:26,147 --> 00:11:28,147
FROM THIS MOMENT ONWARD,

209
00:11:28,147 --> 00:11:32,647
I SHALL PROTECT THE HUMAN EMPIRE
AND ITS CITIZENS IN EARNEST.

210
00:11:32,647 --> 00:11:34,407
I, ALICE SYNTHESIS THIRTY,

211
00:11:34,407 --> 00:11:37,407
HEREBY ABANDON MY RANK
AS AN INTEGRITY KNI--

212
00:11:37,407 --> 00:11:38,947
- ( groaning )
- ( Kirito gasps )

213
00:11:38,947 --> 00:11:40,657
♪

214
00:11:40,657 --> 00:11:41,657
WHAT’S WRONG?

215
00:11:41,657 --> 00:11:43,247
( Alice shrieks )

216
00:11:45,077 --> 00:11:46,077
Kirito: ALICE!

217
00:11:48,337 --> 00:11:49,877
Alice: KIRITO.

218
00:11:49,877 --> 00:11:50,547
( Kirito gasps )

219
00:11:52,127 --> 00:11:54,127
( Alice gasping )

220
00:11:54,127 --> 00:11:55,587
Kirito: LET ME SEE.

221
00:11:58,387 --> 00:11:59,307
( gasps )

222
00:12:00,387 --> 00:12:02,977
IT LOOKS LIKE A...

223
00:12:02,977 --> 00:12:04,387
BAR CODE!

224
00:12:04,387 --> 00:12:05,977
WHAT THE HELL?

225
00:12:05,977 --> 00:12:08,857
- ( gasps )
- ( Alice gasping )

226
00:12:08,857 --> 00:12:12,237
MY EYE, IT BURNS SO.

227
00:12:12,237 --> 00:12:14,647
I SEE SYMBOLS, WORDS.

228
00:12:14,647 --> 00:12:16,067
Kirito: DON’T THINK
ABOUT ANYTHING!

229
00:12:16,067 --> 00:12:18,027
HURRY! CLEAR YOUR MIND!

230
00:12:18,027 --> 00:12:20,487
WHAT’S HAPPENING IS,
WHEN YOU DEFIED THE CHURCH,

231
00:12:20,487 --> 00:12:22,697
IT TRIGGERED
SOME KIND OF MENTAL BARRIER.

232
00:12:22,697 --> 00:12:24,247
THAT’S WHAT’S CAUSING THE PAIN,

233
00:12:24,247 --> 00:12:26,077
AND, IF YOU KEEP
THINKING ABOUT IT,

234
00:12:26,077 --> 00:12:26,827
YOUR EYE WILL EXPLODE.

235
00:12:29,337 --> 00:12:31,417
Alice: HOW CRUEL.

236
00:12:31,417 --> 00:12:35,007
NOT ONLY ARE MY MEMORIES
TAMPERED WITH,

237
00:12:35,007 --> 00:12:38,717
BUT MY WILL, EVEN THAT.

238
00:12:38,717 --> 00:12:41,637
WHOEVER DID THIS IS EVIL.

239
00:12:41,637 --> 00:12:46,437
TELL ME, IS THE ONE
WHO BURNED THESE--

240
00:12:46,437 --> 00:12:48,807
THESE WORDS ONTO MY EYE,

241
00:12:48,807 --> 00:12:52,977
WAS IT HER?
WAS IT THE PONTIFEX?

242
00:12:52,977 --> 00:12:55,357
Kirito: NO.
I DON’T THINK IT’S HER.

243
00:12:55,357 --> 00:13:00,027
IT’S A CREATOR, WATCHING
THIS WORLD FROM THE OUTSIDE,

244
00:13:00,027 --> 00:13:03,997
LIKE A GOD, BUT NOT LIKE
THE ONES IN YOUR CREATION STORY.

245
00:13:03,997 --> 00:13:04,787
Alice: A GOD?

246
00:13:06,157 --> 00:13:09,207
WE KNIGHTS ARE THEIR SERVANTS.

247
00:13:09,207 --> 00:13:12,247
WE HAVE FOUGHT ENDLESSLY
IN THEIR NAME.

248
00:13:12,247 --> 00:13:15,087
WE PROTECT THEIR WORLD.

249
00:13:15,087 --> 00:13:17,427
YET THEY DO NOT EVEN TRUST US.

250
00:13:17,427 --> 00:13:22,847
THEY TOOK MY MEMORIES
OF MY FAMILY AND SISTER.

251
00:13:22,847 --> 00:13:26,227
THEY CAST
THIS DIABOLICAL HEX ON ME

252
00:13:26,227 --> 00:13:29,307
TO ENSURE MY SERVITUDE TO THEM.

253
00:13:29,307 --> 00:13:32,477
I AM NOT A PUPPET!

254
00:13:32,477 --> 00:13:37,197
EVEN IF I AM
THE CREATION OF ANOTHER ENTITY,

255
00:13:37,197 --> 00:13:39,487
MY MIND IS MY OWN,

256
00:13:39,487 --> 00:13:43,447
AND I WILL PROTECT THIS WORLD
AND ALL THE PEOPLE IN IT!

257
00:13:43,447 --> 00:13:47,117
REGARDLESS WHAT THEY WANT,
THAT IS MY MISSION!

258
00:13:47,117 --> 00:13:48,957
Kirito: ALICE.

259
00:13:54,047 --> 00:13:55,257
Alice: KIRITO...

260
00:13:55,257 --> 00:13:59,007
TO BREAK THIS,
I NEED YOU TO HOLD ME.

261
00:13:59,007 --> 00:14:00,927
Kirito: SURE.

262
00:14:00,927 --> 00:14:02,387
( Alice gasps )

263
00:14:02,387 --> 00:14:04,967
HEAR ME, ADMINISTRATOR

264
00:14:04,967 --> 00:14:06,927
AND YOU HEARTLESS GODS.

265
00:14:08,767 --> 00:14:11,897
FOR THE SAKE OF MY MISSION
AND THIS WORLD,

266
00:14:11,897 --> 00:14:14,817
I HEREBY RENOUNCE YOU!

267
00:14:24,157 --> 00:14:26,447
( door creaks )

268
00:14:26,447 --> 00:14:28,247
- Woman: EUGEO.
- ( Eugeo gasps )

269
00:14:28,247 --> 00:14:29,287
Woman: EUGEO!

270
00:14:29,287 --> 00:14:31,367
♪

271
00:14:35,167 --> 00:14:37,167
YOU MUST BE COLD.

272
00:14:37,167 --> 00:14:40,297
COME ON.
IT’S WARMER HERE. HURRY.

273
00:14:40,297 --> 00:14:42,677
( Eugeo gasps )

274
00:14:50,847 --> 00:14:53,857
MOTHER, IS IT REALLY YOU?

275
00:14:53,857 --> 00:14:55,397
Administrator: OF COURSE IT IS.

276
00:14:55,397 --> 00:14:57,817
NOW, WHO ELSE WOULD I BE?

277
00:14:58,987 --> 00:14:59,647
( Eugeo gasps )

278
00:15:04,447 --> 00:15:06,487
UH, WHERE’S FATHER?

279
00:15:06,487 --> 00:15:08,867
AND MY BROTHERS, WHERE ARE THEY?

280
00:15:08,867 --> 00:15:10,287
( Administrator laughs )

281
00:15:10,287 --> 00:15:11,787
SILLY CHILD!

282
00:15:11,787 --> 00:15:14,327
DON’T YOU REMEMBER?
YOU KILLED THEM ALL.

283
00:15:14,327 --> 00:15:15,957
( Eugeo gasping )

284
00:15:20,467 --> 00:15:21,927
( screams )

285
00:15:21,927 --> 00:15:23,837
( panting )

286
00:15:25,887 --> 00:15:27,967
WHAT HAPPENED TO ME?

287
00:15:27,967 --> 00:15:30,807
HOW DID I GET HERE?

288
00:15:32,477 --> 00:15:34,897
THE LAST THING I REMEMBER

289
00:15:34,897 --> 00:15:38,357
WAS FIGHTING BERCOULI
FROM THE LEGEND.

290
00:15:38,357 --> 00:15:42,447
THEN A LITTLE MAN APPEARED,
CHUDELKIN.

291
00:15:42,447 --> 00:15:45,237
AND, AFTER THAT, I WOKE UP...

292
00:15:46,367 --> 00:15:47,277
BUT WHERE?

293
00:15:51,117 --> 00:15:54,787
IS THIS THE TOP FLOOR
OF THE CENTRAL CATHEDRAL?

294
00:15:56,127 --> 00:15:56,787
( gasps )

295
00:16:04,257 --> 00:16:05,927
( gasps )

296
00:16:05,927 --> 00:16:09,927
IF THIS IS THE TOP FLOOR,
THAT MUST BE HER.

297
00:16:09,927 --> 00:16:11,767
♪

298
00:16:18,647 --> 00:16:20,477
( gasps )

299
00:16:30,077 --> 00:16:32,497
Girl: NO, EUGEO! RUN!

300
00:16:32,497 --> 00:16:34,207
( Eugeo gasping )

301
00:16:34,207 --> 00:16:36,957
♪

302
00:16:36,957 --> 00:16:41,167
SHE’S THE PONTIFEX,
ADMINISTRATOR.

303
00:16:41,167 --> 00:16:43,877
NOW’S MY CHANCE.

304
00:16:43,877 --> 00:16:47,337
NO. I CAN’T USE
THE DAGGER ON HER.

305
00:16:47,337 --> 00:16:49,427
I WAS SAVING IT FOR ALICE.

306
00:16:49,427 --> 00:16:51,757
Girl: EUGEO! RUN!

307
00:16:53,177 --> 00:16:56,137
♪

308
00:16:56,137 --> 00:16:57,267
( Eugeo gasps )

309
00:17:06,607 --> 00:17:07,857
( Administrator yawns )

310
00:17:11,447 --> 00:17:12,447
YOU PITIFUL THING.

311
00:17:12,447 --> 00:17:15,407
Eugeo: HUH? "PITIFUL"?

312
00:17:15,407 --> 00:17:18,417
Administrator: THAT’S RIGHT.
YOU LOOK SO MISERABLE,

313
00:17:18,417 --> 00:17:22,127
JUST LIKE A FLOWER
WITHERING AWAY IN A POT.

314
00:17:22,127 --> 00:17:24,667
Eugeo: A FLOWER. M-ME?

315
00:17:24,667 --> 00:17:27,587
Administrator: YES. IF YOU
COULD SEE YOURSELF, YOU’D AGREE.

316
00:17:27,587 --> 00:17:30,467
YOU LOOK PARCHED, STARVING,

317
00:17:30,467 --> 00:17:31,467
Eugeo: FOR WHAT?

318
00:17:31,467 --> 00:17:33,177
Administrator: FOR LOVE.

319
00:17:33,177 --> 00:17:36,307
Eugeo: "LOVE"? NO WAY.

320
00:17:36,307 --> 00:17:39,557
YOU’RE WRONG.
I AM LOVED BY LOTS OF PEOPLE.

321
00:17:39,557 --> 00:17:40,767
Administrator:
YOU’VE NEVER KNOWN

322
00:17:40,767 --> 00:17:43,437
WHAT IT MEANS
TO BE LOVED BY ANYONE.

323
00:17:43,437 --> 00:17:45,277
THAT’S WHY YOU’RE SO SAD.

324
00:17:45,277 --> 00:17:47,487
Eugeo: THAT’S NOT TRUE!

325
00:17:47,487 --> 00:17:50,567
THERE’S MY MOM. SHE LOVED ME.

326
00:17:50,567 --> 00:17:53,487
WHENEVER I HAD A NIGHTMARE
AND I COULDN’T SLEEP,

327
00:17:53,487 --> 00:17:56,697
SHE’D HOLD ME AND SING LULLABIES
TO MAKE ME FEEL BETTER!

328
00:17:56,697 --> 00:17:58,247
Administrator: PERHAPS SHE DID,

329
00:17:58,247 --> 00:18:00,747
BUT WAS THAT LOVE
MEANT ONLY FOR YOU?

330
00:18:00,747 --> 00:18:02,287
YOU KNOW IT WASN’T.

331
00:18:02,287 --> 00:18:04,047
IT WAS WHAT SHE HAD LEFT OVER

332
00:18:04,047 --> 00:18:05,417
AFTER SHARING IT
WITH YOUR BROTHERS.

333
00:18:06,707 --> 00:18:09,427
Eugeo: NO WAY. SHE LOVED ME.

334
00:18:09,427 --> 00:18:12,757
SHE DID. I WAS THE ONE
SHE LOVED THE MOST.

335
00:18:12,757 --> 00:18:15,427
Administrator: YOU WANTED
HER LOVE ALL FOR YOURSELF,

336
00:18:15,427 --> 00:18:17,557
BUT SHE LOVED THE OTHERS MORE.

337
00:18:17,557 --> 00:18:19,597
THAT’S WHY YOU HATE THEM SO.

338
00:18:19,597 --> 00:18:23,107
YOUR FATHER, YOUR BROTHERS,
THEY STOLE IT.

339
00:18:23,107 --> 00:18:24,897
Eugeo: STOP IT. LIAR.

340
00:18:24,897 --> 00:18:27,527
I DON’T HATE MY FATHER
OR MY BROTHERS!

341
00:18:27,527 --> 00:18:28,817
I AM NOT JEALOUS!

342
00:18:28,817 --> 00:18:30,657
Administrator: OH, BUT YOU ARE.

343
00:18:30,657 --> 00:18:32,737
WHY ELSE WOULD
YOU ATTACK THAT BOY?

344
00:18:32,737 --> 00:18:34,277
Eugeo: WHAT BOY?

345
00:18:34,277 --> 00:18:36,237
Administrator:
THE ONE WHO CAME BETWEEN YOU

346
00:18:36,237 --> 00:18:38,497
AND THE RED-HAIRED GIRL
WHO LOVED YOU,

347
00:18:38,497 --> 00:18:40,787
WHO LOVED ONLY YOU.

348
00:18:40,787 --> 00:18:44,207
WHEN THE BOY KIDNAPPED HER
AND TRIED TO DEFILE HER,

349
00:18:44,207 --> 00:18:46,417
YOU WANTED TO KILL HIM.

350
00:18:46,417 --> 00:18:50,087
YOU HATED HIM, BECAUSE HE
TOOK SOMETHING THAT WAS YOURS.

351
00:18:51,427 --> 00:18:52,547
Eugeo: YOU’RE WRONG.

352
00:18:52,547 --> 00:18:54,427
THAT’S NOT--

353
00:18:54,427 --> 00:18:57,267
I-I DIDN’T ATTACK RAIOS
BECAUSE I WAS JEALOUS OF HIM.

354
00:18:57,267 --> 00:19:00,097
Administrator: AND, YET,
HERE YOU ARE ALONE.

355
00:19:00,097 --> 00:19:02,727
NO ONE LOVES YOU.

356
00:19:02,727 --> 00:19:05,057
THEY DECIDED
THEY DON’T NEED YOU ANYMORE

357
00:19:05,057 --> 00:19:08,817
AND ABANDONED YOU. BY NOW,
THEY’VE FORGOTTEN ABOUT YOU.

358
00:19:08,817 --> 00:19:11,527
Eugeo: NO. YOU’RE LYING.

359
00:19:11,527 --> 00:19:14,277
THERE’S STILL
SOMEONE WHO WANTS ME.

360
00:19:16,157 --> 00:19:18,287
ALICE. THAT’S IT!

361
00:19:18,287 --> 00:19:20,157
ALICE STILL NEEDS ME.

362
00:19:20,157 --> 00:19:21,957
- Administrator: ARE YOU SURE?
- ( Eugeo gasps )

363
00:19:21,957 --> 00:19:23,787
DOES SHE LOVE YOU?

364
00:19:23,787 --> 00:19:27,337
DOES SHE LOVE YOU AND ONLY YOU?

365
00:19:27,337 --> 00:19:28,627
( Eugeo gasps )

366
00:19:28,627 --> 00:19:30,167
Administrator:
YOU SEEM TO HAVE FORGOTTEN.

367
00:19:30,167 --> 00:19:32,547
I CAN HELP YOU REMEMBER.

368
00:19:32,547 --> 00:19:35,677
YOU HAVE BURIED THE MEMORY
DEEP WITHIN YOUR HEART,

369
00:19:35,677 --> 00:19:38,137
BUT I CAN UNEARTH IT.

370
00:19:38,137 --> 00:19:39,057
( Eugeo gasps )

371
00:19:40,637 --> 00:19:41,597
( footsteps pattering )

372
00:19:43,477 --> 00:19:46,477
I HAVEN’T SEEN
KIRITO AND ALICE ALL MORNING.

373
00:19:46,477 --> 00:19:48,147
( sighs ) WHERE COULD THEY BE?

374
00:19:48,147 --> 00:19:48,977
( gasps )

375
00:19:51,487 --> 00:19:54,817
AH. ALI--EH?

376
00:19:54,817 --> 00:19:58,657
Kirito: HEY, HE’S GONNA COME
LOOKIN’ FOR US. LET’S GO BACK.

377
00:19:58,657 --> 00:20:00,157
Alice: OH, STOP WORRYING.

378
00:20:00,157 --> 00:20:02,537
WE CAN STAY A BIT LONGER,
JUST A BIT.

379
00:20:02,537 --> 00:20:05,577
♪

380
00:20:05,577 --> 00:20:06,247
Eugeo: NO.

381
00:20:10,047 --> 00:20:12,837
THIS ISN’T REAL.
IT DIDN’T HAPPEN.

382
00:20:12,837 --> 00:20:14,297
Administrator: I TOLD YOU SO.

383
00:20:17,757 --> 00:20:20,387
NOW DO YOU BELIEVE ME?

384
00:20:20,387 --> 00:20:24,307
SHE DOESN’T LOVE YOU,
NOT JUST YOU, AT ANY RATE.

385
00:20:24,307 --> 00:20:26,517
POOR THING. IN FACT,

386
00:20:26,517 --> 00:20:29,477
SHE DIDN’T HAVE ANY LOVE FOR YOU
FROM THE START.

387
00:20:29,477 --> 00:20:31,437
( woman vocalizing )

388
00:20:31,437 --> 00:20:34,947
I’M NOTHING LIKE
THAT GIRL, EUGEO.

389
00:20:34,947 --> 00:20:37,157
I WOULD BE HAPPY TO LOVE YOU.

390
00:20:37,157 --> 00:20:41,157
I’D GIVE YOU ALL OF IT,
JUST YOU AND NO ONE ELSE.

391
00:20:45,667 --> 00:20:47,747
Eugeo: NO ONE ELSE.

392
00:20:57,717 --> 00:21:01,557
Administrator:
NOW COME CLOSER, EUGEO.

393
00:21:04,227 --> 00:21:07,267
I WILL SHOW YOU WHAT LOVE IS,

394
00:21:07,267 --> 00:21:10,307
AND YOU CAN LOVE ME
AS MUCH AS YOU WANT.

395
00:21:10,307 --> 00:21:12,897
IF YOU GIVE ME ALL OF YOUR LOVE,

396
00:21:12,897 --> 00:21:17,197
I WILL GIVE YOU
ALL THE LOVE I HAVE IN RETURN.

397
00:21:17,197 --> 00:21:19,737
AND THE DEEPER
YOUR LOVE IS FOR ME,

398
00:21:19,737 --> 00:21:23,157
THE MORE OF ITS PLEASURES
WILL I THEN SHOW YOU,

399
00:21:23,157 --> 00:21:26,867
PLEASURES BEYOND
YOUR WILDEST DREAMS.

400
00:21:26,867 --> 00:21:31,337
Eugeo: IS THAT REALLY
WHAT LOVE IS ABOUT,

401
00:21:31,337 --> 00:21:35,587
A THING YOU TRADE LIKE MONEY?

402
00:21:35,587 --> 00:21:36,967
IS THAT ALL IT IS?

403
00:21:36,967 --> 00:21:38,587
Tiese: NO, EUGEO.

404
00:21:38,587 --> 00:21:41,677
( Eugeo gasps )

405
00:21:41,677 --> 00:21:43,757
Tiese: THAT’S NOT TRUE.
THAT ISN’T LOVE!

406
00:21:43,757 --> 00:21:45,267
♪

407
00:21:51,647 --> 00:21:53,937
( singing in Japanese )

408
00:21:53,937 --> 00:21:55,487
Alice: DON’T BE FOOLED, EUGEO!

409
00:21:55,487 --> 00:21:57,607
( Eugeo gasps )

410
00:21:57,607 --> 00:21:59,197
Alice: LOVE ISN’T LIKE THAT!

411
00:21:59,197 --> 00:22:01,737
YOU DON’T GIVE YOUR LOVE
TO GET SOMETHING IN RETURN!

412
00:22:08,917 --> 00:22:10,417
- Kirito: EUGEO!
- ( Eugeo gasps )

413
00:22:11,827 --> 00:22:13,337
( singing in Japanese )

414
00:22:18,667 --> 00:22:19,337
( Administrator chuckles )

415
00:22:34,607 --> 00:22:37,027
I KNOW WHAT YOU WANT.

416
00:22:37,027 --> 00:22:40,067
YOU WANT TO FORGET
ALL OF YOUR SADNESS

417
00:22:40,067 --> 00:22:43,447
AND MAKE LOVE TO ME
’TIL THE END OF TIME.

418
00:22:43,447 --> 00:22:45,367
YOU WILL, BUT NOT YET.

419
00:22:45,367 --> 00:22:49,207
FIRST, MY DEAR,
I MUST HAVE PROOF OF YOUR LOVE.

420
00:22:49,207 --> 00:22:54,587
YOU WILL TRUST ONLY IN ME
AND OFFER ALL OF YOURSELF TO ME.

421
00:22:54,587 --> 00:22:58,007
WHEN I TELL YOU WHAT WORDS
TO SAY, YOU WILL SAY THEM.

422
00:22:58,007 --> 00:23:01,837
NOW INITIATE THE SACRED ARTS.

423
00:23:01,837 --> 00:23:04,427
Eugeo: SYSTEM CALL.

424
00:23:04,427 --> 00:23:07,057
Administrator: GOOD.
NOW REPEAT AFTER ME.

425
00:23:07,057 --> 00:23:09,637
"REMOVE CORE PROTECTION."

426
00:23:09,637 --> 00:23:11,097
Eugeo: REMOVE...

427
00:23:12,647 --> 00:23:15,607
AM I DOING THE RIGHT THING?

428
00:23:15,607 --> 00:23:16,937
CORE...

429
00:23:16,937 --> 00:23:20,607
I DON’T WANT TO BE SAD ANYMORE.

430
00:23:20,607 --> 00:23:22,487
I DON’T WANT TO BE ALONE.

431
00:23:22,487 --> 00:23:24,657
Administrator: THAT’S IT. GOOD.

432
00:23:24,657 --> 00:23:27,907
YOU’RE ALMOST DONE.
COME INTO ME,

433
00:23:27,907 --> 00:23:30,997
INTO ETERNAL STASIS.

434
00:23:30,997 --> 00:23:32,747
Eugeo: ...PROTECTION.

